<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
	The inspection animation.

	Build 42 builds the player's animation tree by walking every media/AnimSets/player
	directory it can resolve, mods included (AnimationSet -> ZomboidFileSystem.resolveAllDirectories),
	so dropping this file in adds "TienInspectWeapon" as a real action node next to the
	vanilla ones in media/AnimSets/player/actions.

	The node is selected by the PerformingAction character variable, which is what
	ISBaseTimedAction:setActionAnim() sets. That variable is not local: PlayerActionsState
	carries it - along with the hand models - in the StatePacket the engine sends when the
	local player enters the state, so every other client plays this same node for them.
	That is the whole of the multiplayer story; see docs/implementation.md.

	The clip is the mod's own, Bob_TienInspect_1H_Raise (media/anims_X/Bob, built in Blender
	by scripts/anim/clips/inspect.py): from the one-handed idle, the weapon comes up in front
	of the chest with its flat towards the eyes, and the head drops to look at it. It ends
	on the first frame of the hold, so the hand-off does not pop. This node is the one-handed
	raise and the fallback for any weapon kind without its own; TienInspectWeapon_2H,
	_Handgun and _Rifle add the Weapon variable to the same condition and win when it
	matches (see those files).

	0.6 s long against the action's InspectSeconds (0.5 s by default, scaled for guns and
	Maintenance): a longer action holds the last frame, a shorter one hands over to the
	hold's blend.

	Deliberately no m_SubStateBoneWeights. EquipItem is the node to copy here - it plays
	Bob_IdleLooting_Mid, whose legs are keyed just as these clips' are, for an action whose
	stopOnWalk is false, and it declares none - so the character keeps walking through it.
-->
<animNode>
	<m_Name>TienInspectWeapon</m_Name>
	<m_AnimName>Bob_TienInspect_1H_Raise</m_AnimName>
	<m_BlendTime>0.40</m_BlendTime>
	<m_SpeedScale>1.0</m_SpeedScale>
	<m_SyncTrackingEnabled>false</m_SyncTrackingEnabled>
	<m_Conditions x_name="7c1f2a90-3d44-4a1f-9c6e-51b0d2a4e8f1">
		<m_Name>PerformingAction</m_Name>
		<m_Type>STRING</m_Type>
		<m_Value>TienInspectWeapon</m_Value>
	</m_Conditions>
</animNode>
